<div class="wrap">
  <section class="block" style="border-bottom:none; padding-top:52px; padding-bottom:60px;">
    <p class="lead">This handbook is a pyramid. At the top is one <strong>vision</strong>, the thing everything answers to. Under it sits our <strong>strategy</strong>, the few commitments that turn the vision into direction. At the base is <strong>execution</strong>, every system and habit that carries it out. Read top down. If anything at the base ever stops serving what is above it, we change the base, never the vision.</p>
  </section>
