<!-- TIER I -->
<div class="tier" id="vision">
  <div class="wrap">
    <svg class="pyr" width="76" height="66" viewBox="0 0 76 66" aria-hidden="true">
      <polygon class="on" points="38,4 27,24 49,24"/><polygon points="27,24 49,24 58,44 18,44"/><polygon points="18,44 58,44 70,64 6,64"/>
    </svg>
    <div>
      <span class="tlabel">Tier I</span>
      <h2>The <strong>vision</strong></h2>
      <p class="tsum">One thing, and everything below serves it. It is not our own. It is Orbit's mission, lived out in a room.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section class="block">
    <h3>Where it starts: the church</h3>
    <p>We do not carry a separate vision. We serve the church's one mission, and worship and production is one of the ways it comes true on a Sunday.</p>
    <div class="quote-mission">We exist so people will find peace and develop purpose by revolving everything around Jesus.<span>Orbit Church &middot; mission</span></div>
    <p>The name is the picture. An orbit is everything held in place by a center. When Jesus is the center, a life settles into the peace and purpose it was made for. Our whole job is to make Him the unmistakable center of the room.</p>

    <h3>The vision for worship &amp; production</h3>
    <div class="conviction">
      <span class="eyebrow">The apex</span>
      <p>We help the room <strong>revolve everything around Jesus.</strong> Every eye, every heart, every song, screen, light, and camera bends toward Him. If people leave having met God, we did our job. If they leave impressed with us, we missed it.</p>
    </div>

    <h3>The fruit: the Orbit Sound</h3>
    <p>Real worship, done with skill and imagination, starts to produce a sound of its own. That is the Orbit Sound. It is not a genre we borrow, it is what comes out of a team that actually worships Jesus. We chase the worship, and the sound follows.</p>

    <div class="conviction">
      <span class="eyebrow">The heart under all of it</span>
      <p>There is no room here for ego or turf. <strong>God does not need any of us.</strong> He will move with or without our help. Obedience is the only currency that counts.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- TIER II -->
<div class="tier" id="strategy">
  <div class="wrap">
    <svg class="pyr" width="76" height="66" viewBox="0 0 76 66" aria-hidden="true">
